Rough edges
-----------
- Only one answer runs at a time, so pressing CLARIFY while an EXPLAIN is
  streaming is refused rather than queued.
- The interpretation is printed in the assistant terminal. That is private only
  as long as that terminal is not the window being shared.
- Multi display setups: --target display captures the main display only.
- The archive lives under var/, which is git ignored; Phase 3 will have to
  decide where canonical meeting data really belongs.
